- 2026-11-23: Item 0.4 closed at design level (Coverage Metric).
  Three independent dimensions: ESS, Support Overlap, Distributional
  Distance — not combined. Two axes: Behavioral Coverage, Structural
  Coverage — reported separately. Thresholds PILOT-DEPENDENT.
  Coverage classifies and interprets, does not exclude cells.
  Distance choice not fixed; recorded before confirmatory experiments.
  Evidence: preregistration/metrics.md Part A.

- 2026-11-23: Item 0.8 closed at design level (Statistical Plan).
  Ranking fidelity: Spearman's rho + Kendall's tau + Top-k (k
  PILOT-DEPENDENT). Selection regret: Regret_eligible
  (coverage-conditioned, primary) and Regret_full (full-set,
  secondary). Rank-ambiguous policies: excluded from ranking metrics,
  retained in regret, reported separately. Multiple comparisons:
  Bonferroni confirmatory, Benjamini-Hochberg exploratory.
  Eligibility rules fixed before confirmatory evaluation;
  no-eligible-policy and ineligible-selection cases reported, not
  excluded.
  Evidence: preregistration/metrics.md Part B.

- 2026-11-23: Item 0.7 closed (Reference Execution Protocol).
  Seeds and repeats separated: seeds measure between-seed variance,
  repeats measure within-scenario variance. Unit of experiment is
  (policy, scenario, seed, repeat_id). Pairwise utility difference
  CI replaces individual policy intervals. Hierarchical bootstrap
  (seeds, then repeats) used. 80% separability is a provisional
  operational acceptance criterion, not a statistical fact. All
  PILOT-DEPENDENT quantities recorded in preregistration/thresholds.md.
  Evidence: design/scenarios.md Part C.

- 2026-11-25: Item 0.1 closed (Utility Function).
  Components: Task Completion Ratio s(π), Normalized Energy
  Consumption E_norm(π). Functional form: success-gated linear,
  U(π) = s(π) · [w_s + w_e · (1 − E_norm(π))]. Weights: w_s = 0.5,
  w_e = 0.5 (primary); W_success (0.75/0.25) and W_energy
  (0.25/0.75) preregistered as secondary. Normalization range
  PILOT-DEPENDENT, recorded in preregistration/thresholds.md.
  Uncertainty register recorded in design/utility.md §8.
  Evidence: design/utility.md.

